      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>A hole is dropped instead of rejected: the assignment copies the array with the engine's own hole-skipping reader (DomBridge/ComputedStyle.cs, GetArrayElements(withHoles: false)), so [a, , b] silently becomes a two-member list where WebIDL converts the value to sequence&lt;CSSStyleSheet&gt; and throws on the undefined the hole yields.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
      </Output>
